  "instruction": "Use Chrome Live Caption on the opened video, determine how long the quick sponge should sit before checking whether the yeast is active, then use https://vclock.com to create a timer for that duration. Leave the timer visible in the browser.",
  "source": "https://foodwishes.blogspot.com/2013/04/pita-bread-whats-in-your-pocket.html",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Turn on Chrome Live Caption.",
    "Watch the YouTube video and use the YouTube captions to determine that the quick sponge should sit for 15 minutes before checking whether the yeast is active.",
    "Open https://vclock.com in the browser.",
    "Click the Timer page.",
    "Create and start a 15 minute timer.",
    "Leave the timer visible in the browser."
  ],
  "config": [
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "parameters": {
        "command": [
          "google-chrome",
          "--remote-debugging-port=1337",
          "--force-renderer-accessibility"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "parameters": {
